#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0263 expect=skipped domain=POOLDEF
#note "THE USUBJID ALL-FACET GATE (Fix #331 bucket 2, M2-D24 / M3-D18; pin owed by review S9 and authored by Fix #340). FRESH FIXTURE - this rule shipped with no scenarios at all. The POOLDEF dataset deliberately declares no USUBJID column, so Requirements.Variables.All [USUBJID] rejects the dataset and the rule is SKIPPED naming USUBJID. Remove the All entry and the rule EXECUTES: since Fix #330 retired the injected var_exists guard, a bare empty(USUBJID) is TRUE on every row of an absent column (absent = all-missing) and nothing else in the Check restricts the rows, so it would fire on EVERY row -- the flood the gate exists for. If this scenario EXECUTES (violation or silent pass), the gate has been removed -- escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset POOLDEF label="Pool Definition"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col POOLID  type=Char label="Pool Identifier"
---
S1 | POOL1
S1 | POOL2
---
